# Upload allowlist for the API project (deployed from the repo root).
# The web project deploys from web/ and never reads this file.
#
# Allowlist, not blocklist: the root holds .env, keys.txt, a 4 GB .venv and the
# 2.7 GB model cache, and a forgotten line in a blocklist would ship one of them.
# requirements.txt stays out too - it pins CUDA torch, and the build must take
# its dependencies from pyproject.toml alone.
/*
!/rag
!/pyproject.toml
!/vercel.json
/rag/__pycache__
